    \[ \mathbf A(I,0,B) := (\Omega^{0,\bullet}(X),\wedge,\bar \partial, 2\pi \mathbf{i} {B^{0,2}}). \hfill\qedhere\]

We define the $\beta$-deformed Dolbeault algebra as 
